    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "7D958A20BDDA2EB7",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳之前聽我說話。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
