    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "1EAB957E6B7BF083",
      "text": "也許我還寶刀未老喔？\\c\\n謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳與我對戰，\\n我打得很開心。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
